
// GENERATED. The pillars carry no ops of their own - they are multilocs whose children are the
// lit pillar models - so the only way to work one is to use the hand mirror on it, which is what
// a hand mirror is for. One click cycles: place at 0, then 1, then 2, then 3, then take it back.

